        {
            "block_label": "vision_footnote",
            "block_content": "PLATE 54. Laying out a column casting of a vertical milling machine preliminary to machining. Note the care shown in laying out each surface to be machined. (Courtesy - Kearney & Trecker Corp.)",
            "block_bbox": [
